Most Important Methods to Memorize
Method	Purpose
put(key, value)	Insert or update
get(key)	Get value
getOrDefault(key, defaultValue)	Get value or default
putIfAbsent(key, value)	Insert only if key is absent
containsKey(key)	Check key
containsValue(value)	Check value
remove(key)	Remove entry
replace(key, value)	Update value
keySet()	Get all keys
values()	Get all values
entrySet()	Get key-value pairs
forEach((k, v) -> {})	Iterate with lambda
size()	Number of entries
clear()	Remove all entries
isEmpty()	Check if empty